{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55126","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主年上，须要克游都。\n克得此宫爲大胜，多应擒捉贼（京本作「客」）酋徒，半虏半降诛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}